はい！はい！はい！はい！
Hai! Hai! Hai! Hai!

465
00:55:51,157 --> 00:55:52,957
Back to you, Princess!

466
00:55:53,857 --> 00:56:01,157
ずっと眠ってる 私の愛の揺りかご
Resting asleep forever in the cradle of my love,

467
00:56:01,357 --> 00:56:08,557
あなただけが 夢の使者に呼ばれる朝がくる
the morning comes when only you will be summoned by the messenger of dreams.

468
00:56:08,957 --> 00:56:15,757
細い首筋を 月あかりが映してる
The moonlight reflects upon your slender neck.

469
00:56:15,957 --> 00:56:23,157
世界中の時を止めて 閉じこめたいけど
I want to stop time all across the world and trap it here, but...

470
00:56:23,557 --> 00:56:30,957
もしもふたり逢えたことに意味があるなら
If there is meaning to the two of us meeting,

471
00:56:31,157 --> 00:56:38,157
私はそう 自由を知るためのバイブル
then I am a bible for you to know freedom.

472
00:56:38,357 --> 00:56:46,157
残酷な天使のテーゼ 悲しみがそして始まる
Like a cruel angel's thesis, and so sadness begins.

473
00:56:46,357 --> 00:56:53,557
抱きしめた命のかたち その夢に目覚めたとき
When you awaken to the dream of the form of life you held,

474
00:56:53,757 --> 00:57:01,157
誰よりも光を放つ 少年よ 神話になれ
young boy, shine brighter than anyone else and become a legend!

475
00:57:01,357 --> 00:57:08,357
人は愛をつむぎながら 歴史をつくる
While weaving love, humankind creates history.

476
00:57:08,557 --> 00:57:15,857
女神なんてなれないまま 私は生きる
Unable to become a goddess, I live on.

477
00:57:16,157 --> 00:57:23,857
残酷な天使のテーゼ 窓辺からやがて飛び立つ
Like a cruel angel's thesis, you will soon take flight from the window.

478
00:57:23,957 --> 00:57:31,357
ほとばしる熱いパトスで 思い出を裏切るなら
If you betray memories with overflowing burning pathos,

479
00:57:31,557 --> 00:57:38,957
この空を抱いて輝く 少年よ 神話になれ
embrace the skies and shine bright, young boy, become a legend!

480
00:58:05,357 --> 01:00:02,357
無料パートは終了いたしました。ご視聴ありがとうございました！
The free sneak peek part of the show has ended. Thank you for watching!

